<p class="tt-ilede">Leading a school group off-site requires precise logistical support so you can focus entirely on teaching and pupil welfare. We provide dedicated on-the-road leaders, pre-booked curriculum workshops, and comprehensive trip folders for every travelling teacher.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>
<!-- /wp:group --></div>
<!-- /wp:group -->

<!-- wp:group {"className":"tt-sec tt-isec","layout":{"type":"default"},"align":"full"} -->
<div class="wp-block-group alignfull tt-sec tt-isec"><!-- wp:group {"className":"tt-wrap","layout":{"type":"default"}} -->
<div class="wp-block-group tt-wrap"><!-- wp:group {"className":"tt-brows sp-stagger","layout":{"type":"default"}} -->
<div class="wp-block-group tt-brows sp-stagger"><!-- wp:group {"className":"tt-brow sp-reveal sp-reveal--up","layout":{"type":"default"}} -->
<div class="wp-block-group tt-brow sp-reveal sp-reveal--up"><!-- wp:heading {"level":2,"className":"tt-brow__h"} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading tt-brow__h">Your trip week</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:group {"className":"tt-brow__b","layout":{"type":"default"}} -->
<div class="wp-block-group tt-brow__b"><!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>On the road, each day follows an established, orderly sequence designed to keep pupils engaged and leaders relaxed. From day one departures to day five returns, our leaders handle transport transitions, check-in desks, and meal services.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>We maintain a strict ratio of one leader for every ten students, counting accompanying teachers as leaders. While our staff coordinate coach timings, tickets, and site staff, you remain free to focus on student learning, group morale, and academic discussions.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>
<!-- /wp:group --></div>
<!-- /wp:group -->

<!-- wp:group {"className":"tt-brow sp-reveal sp-reveal--up","layout":{"type":"default"}} -->
<div class="wp-block-group tt-brow sp-reveal sp-reveal--up"><!-- wp:heading {"level":2,"className":"tt-brow__h"} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading tt-brow__h">In your trip folder</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:group {"className":"tt-brow__b","layout":{"type":"default"}} -->
<div class="wp-block-group tt-brow__b"><!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Before departing the school gates, every teacher receives a waterproof trip folder containing all necessary operational records. Inside, you will find coach seat allocations, hostel room lists, medical and dietary sheets, and daily schedule cards with exact timings.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>The folder also includes laminated emergency cards displaying our direct twenty-four-hour duty line number at plus forty-four one six three two nine six zero four nine nine. With all information immediately accessible in print, you never have to scramble for phone numbers or paperwork.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>
<!-- /wp:group --></div>
<!-- /wp:group --></div>
<!-- /wp:group --></div>
<!-- /wp:group --></div>
<!-- /wp:group -->

<!-- wp:group {"className":"tt-sec tt-isec","layout":{"type":"default"},"align":"full"} -->
<div class="wp-block-group alignfull tt-sec tt-isec"><!-- wp:group {"className":"tt-wrap","layout":{"type":"default"}} -->
<div class="wp-block-group tt-wrap"><!-- wp:heading {"level":2,"className":"tt-h2 tt-isec__h"} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading tt-h2 tt-isec__h">Workshops that fit the curriculum</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph {"className":"tt-ilede tt-ilede--sm"} -->
<p class="tt-ilede tt-ilede--sm">Our academic visits are structured around concrete syllabus outcomes rather than passive sightseeing. For history groups, we arrange source-based workshops such as analysing the nine-hundred-year-old Bayeux embroidery or exploring Normandy landing beaches. Geography groups examine active coastal erosion and river processes along the Atlantic coast, or conduct fieldwork on volcanic formations. Science students examine local geology, while language groups participate in structured morning language sessions before conversational practice with vetted host families in Seville.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:group {"className":"tt-trips__wrap sp-reveal sp-reveal--up","layout":{"type":"default"}} -->
